{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-4-1","title":"Hebrews 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The rest of Christians is attained by faith. 12 The power of God's word. 14 By our high priest Jesus, the Son of God, 16 we may and must go boldly to the throne of grace.</p>\n<p>us therefore. 11; 2:1-3; 12:15,25; 13:7; Pr 14:16; 28:14; Jer 32:40; Ro 11:20 1Co 10:12 a promise. 9; Nu 14:34; 1Sa 2:30; Ro 3:3,4; 2Ti 2:13 his. 3-5; 3:11 any. Mt 7:21-23,26,27; 24:48-51; 25:1-3; Lu 12:45,46; 13:25-30; Ro 3:23 1Co 9:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-2","title":"Hebrews 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>unto us. Ac 3:26; 13:46; Ga 3:8; 4:13; 1Pe 1:12 preached. Gr. of hearing. Ro 10:16,17; *marg: did. Ro 2:25; 1Co 13:3; 1Ti 4:8 not being, etc. or because they were not united by faith to. 6; 3:12,18,19; 11:6; 1Th 1:5; 2:13; 2Th 2:12,13; Jas 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-3","title":"Hebrews 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>we. 3:14; Isa 28:12; Jer 6:16; Mt 11:28,29; Ro 5:1,2 As I. 3:11; Ps 95:11 the works. Ge 1:31; Ex 20:11 from. 9:26; Mt 13:35; Eph 1:4; 1Pe 1:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-4","title":"Hebrews 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>in. 2:6 God. Ge 2:1,2; Ex 20:11; 31:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-5","title":"Hebrews 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>3; 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-6","title":"Hebrews 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>it remaineth. 9; 1Co 7:29 some. Nu 14:12,31; Isa 65:15; Mt 21:43; 22:9,10; Lu 14:21-24; Ac 13:46,47 Ac 28:28 they. 2; 3:19; Ga 3:8 it was. or, the gospel was. entered. 3:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-7","title":"Hebrews 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>saying. 3:7,8; 2Sa 23:1,2; Mt 22:43; Mr 12:36; Lu 20:42; Ac 2:29,31; 28:25 To day. 3:7,15; Ps 95:7 after. 1Ki 6:1; Ac 13:20-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-8","title":"Hebrews 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Jesus, that is, Joshua. Ac 7:45 had. 11:13-15; De 12:9; 25:19; Jos 1:15; 22:4; 23:1; Ps 78:55; 105:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-9","title":"Hebrews 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>remaineth. 1,3; 3:11; Isa 11:10; 57:2; 60:19,20; Re 7:14-17; 21:4 rest. or, keeping of a sabbath. people. 11:25; Ps 47:9; Mt 1:21; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-10","title":"Hebrews 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>he that. 1:3; 10:12; Re 14:13 hath. Joh 19:30; 1Pe 4:1,2 as. 3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-11","title":"Hebrews 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Let. 1; 6:11; Mt 7:13; 11:12,28-30; Lu 13:24; 16:16; Joh 6:27; Php 2:12 2Pe 1:10,11 lest. 3:12,18,19 unbelief. or, disobedience. Ac 26:19; Ro 11:30-32; Eph 2:2; 5:6; Col 3:6; Tit 1:16; 3:3; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-4-12","title":"Hebrews 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>the word. 13:7; Isa 49:2; Lu 8:11; Ac 4:31; 2Co 2:17; 4:2; Re 20:4 is quick. Ps 110:2; 119:130; Ec 12:11; Isa 55:11; Jer 23:29;